      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِيَّةٌ شَمَخٌ</span></b>  (L, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَمُوخٌ</span></b>  (L) <i>A distant,
