or <i>design;</i> [in an action or a journey &amp;c.;] (L,
K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نيَّةٌ زَمَخٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَمُوخٌ</span>. (L.)

